    <bpmn:process id="W_W4851" name="W4851. New-Site/New-Activity License Acquisition Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New store open (VS-37); DC; off-site asset (VS-164 locker, VS-163 EV charger); new service (VS-156 VAS); remodel scope change (VS-109)
Frequency: Per new site/activity (~10–15 new stores/yr + new services/assets)
Volume: ~15–25 new-site/activity acquisitions per year (10–15 new stores + remodels/DC changes)
Owner: Compliance Operations / Regulatory Intelligence (W4843)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), Real Estate (VS-97), Government Affairs (VS-104), domain owners, providers (W4854)
Source: workflow W4851 — New-Site/New-Activity License Acquisition Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4851_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4851_Lane1" name="Regulatory Intelligence">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4851_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4851_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4851_Lane2" name="Compliance Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4851_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4851_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4851_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4851_Start4" name="New store open (VS-37); DC; off-site asset (VS-164 locker, VS-163 EV charger); new…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4851_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4851_Task5" name="On new site/activity, generate the required-permit checklist from the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On new site/activity, generate the required-permit checklist from the obligation map (W4843) for that site type/activity/geography (LGU business permit, barangay, BFP, DENR ECC if applicable, BIR branch/CAS, sanitary, signage, occupancy, plus activity-specific e.g., BSP accreditation for VAS, NPC registration for data); sequence by the go-live timeline (VS-37)
Responsible (R): Regulatory Intelligence / Compliance Operations
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per new site/activity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4851_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4851_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4851_Task6" name="Execute acquisition in parallel with site build/open (VS-37/VS-109): assign…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute acquisition in parallel with site build/open (VS-37/VS-109): assign owners (W4844), file applications, manage LGU/regulator processing, and obtain authorizations before go-live; coordinate the fee budget (VS-17) and providers (W4854)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Domain Owners / Providers / Real Estate
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager / COO
Duration: Per new site/activity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4851_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4851_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4851_Task7" name="On receipt, load authorizations to the register (W4842), set the renewal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On receipt, load authorizations to the register (W4842), set the renewal calendar (W4845), file evidence (W4846), and confirm go-live-readiness (no activity before authorizations in place); hand off to operations (VS-07)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per new site/activity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4851_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4851_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4851_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4851_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-729 (ensure controlled execution — Renewal Execution, Inspection Coordination &amp; Multi-Site Campaigns (PA-166.2).) | - CTL-729: obligation-map checklist applied; authorizations obtained before go-live; recorded in register
Owner: Compliance Operations / Regulatory Intelligence (W4843)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4851_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4851_Annotation9" targetRef="W4851_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4851_Flow11" sourceRef="W4851_Start4" targetRef="W4851_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4851_Flow12" sourceRef="W4851_Task5" targetRef="W4851_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4851_Flow13" sourceRef="W4851_Task6" targetRef="W4851_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4851_Flow14" sourceRef="W4851_Task7" targetRef="W4851_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
