    <bpmn:process id="W_W4852" name="W4852. Regulator Inspection/Audit Coordination, Calendar &amp; Response Hub" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Regulator inspection/audit notice (BIR, DOLE, BFP, DENR, LGU, PCAB, NPC, BSP, FDA); scheduled inspection; complaint-triggered
Frequency: Ad hoc + scheduled
Volume: ~150–250 inspections/audits per year across regulators and ~205 sites
Owner: Compliance Operations / Compliance Portfolio Manager
Participants: Domain owners, Legal (VS-100.3), site managers, Internal Audit (VS-21), Records (VS-88)
Source: workflow W4852 — Regulator Inspection/Audit Coordination, Calendar &amp; Response Hub</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4852_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4852_Lane1" name="Compliance Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4852_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4852_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4852_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4852_Lane2" name="Domain Owner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4852_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4852_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4852_Start4" name="Regulator inspection/audit notice (BIR, DOLE, BFP, DENR, LGU, PCAB, NPC, BSP, FDA)…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4852_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4852_Task5" name="Receive &amp; log the inspection/audit notice, scope it (regulator, entity/site…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive &amp; log the inspection/audit notice, scope it (regulator, entity/site, authorization, subject), assign the response owner (W4844), and assemble the evidence packet from the repository (W4846) and records (VS-88); maintain an inspection calendar to avoid clashing inspections
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Domain Owner / Records
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per event (immediate)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4852_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4852_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4852_Task6" name="Host the inspection/audit, respond to findings, and coordinate corrective…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Host the inspection/audit, respond to findings, and coordinate corrective action across domain owners (e.g., BFP fire-safety fix via VS-138, DOLE labor via VS-19/VS-84, BIR via VS-79); manage the written response to the regulator
Responsible (R): Domain Owner / Legal / Site Manager
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4852_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4852_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4852_Task7" name="Track corrective-action closure, document the outcome in the audit trail…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track corrective-action closure, document the outcome in the audit trail (W4846), manage any penalty (W4858), and feed inspection findings to risk tiering (W4848), governance (W4864), and analytics (W4862)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4852_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4852_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4852_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4852_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-729 (ensure controlled execution — Renewal Execution, Inspection Coordination &amp; Multi-Site Campaigns (PA-166.2).) | - CTL-729: inspection response owner assigned; findings corrected &amp; closed; outcome documented
Owner: Compliance Operations / Compliance Portfolio Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4852_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4852_Annotation9" targetRef="W4852_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
