        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4854_Lane3" name="Compliance Portfolio">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4854_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4854_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4854_Start5" name="Permit-service need (renewal W4849, acquisition W4851, inspection W4852); provider…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4854_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4854_Task6" name="Maintain the approved permit-service-provider panel: fixers/consultants/agents…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the approved permit-service-provider panel: fixers/consultants/agents by region/regulator (LGU, BFP, DENR, BIR, PCAB), with due diligence (TPRM VS-161 — financial, ABC/anti-corruption VS-86, competence, references); contract via Procurement/Legal with scope, fees, SLA, and ABC clauses
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / TPRM / Compliance Portfolio
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous + per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4854_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4854_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4854_Task7" name="Engage per need (W4849/W4851/W4852): assign the provider, track the deliverable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Engage per need (W4849/W4851/W4852): assign the provider, track the deliverable (permit obtained/renewed), verify authenticity, and reconcile the fee (VS-17); enforce the ABC/anti-corruption standard (no bribery of officials — links to VS-86/VS-119) and the data-privacy standard (VS-91) for any data shared
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations / Domain Owner / Provider
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4854_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4854_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4854_Task8" name="Monitor provider performance &amp; compliance (SLA, ABC, renewals-obtained, cost)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monitor provider performance &amp; compliance (SLA, ABC, renewals-obtained, cost), manage under-performance/failure (W4853 continuity), re-compete, and feed provider record to TPRM (VS-161) and analytics (W4862); report provider-related ABC risk to governance (W4864)
Responsible (R): Compliance Portfolio / Procurement / TPRM / ABC
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4854_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4854_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4854_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4854_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-729 (ensure controlled execution — Renewal Execution, Inspection Coordination &amp; Multi-Site Campaigns (PA-166.2).) | - CTL-729: providers DD&#x27;d (TPRM/ABC); ABC clauses in contract; deliverable verified; performance monitored
Owner: Compliance Portfolio Manager / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34) / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
