    <bpmn:process id="W_W4856" name="W4856. Permit Variation, Scope Change &amp; Site-Transfer/Closure Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business/activity change (scope expansion, new product line, signage change, floor-area change); site transfer/closure (VS-59); entity restructuring
Frequency: Per change
Volume: ~30–60 permit variations/changes per year
Owner: Compliance Operations / Domain Owners
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), Real Estate (VS-97), Legal (VS-100.3), Government Affairs (VS-104)
Source: workflow W4856 — Permit Variation, Scope Change &amp; Site-Transfer/Closure Handling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4856_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4856_Lane1" name="Regulatory Intelligence">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4856_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4856_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4856_Lane2" name="Domain Owner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4856_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4856_Lane3" name="Compliance Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4856_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4856_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4856_Start5" name="Business/activity change (scope expansion, new product line, signage change, floor-area…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4856_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4856_Task6" name="Detect the change-trigger (scope/activity/scope/signage/area change, store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Detect the change-trigger (scope/activity/scope/signage/area change, store closure VS-59, transfer, entity restructuring) and assess permit impact from the obligation map (W4843): which authorizations need variation/amendment/surrender/new-application
Responsible (R): Regulatory Intelligence / Compliance Operations / Domain Owner
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4856_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4856_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4856_Task7" name="Execute the variation: file amendments with the relevant regulators (e.g…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute the variation: file amendments with the relevant regulators (e.g., expanded floor area → amended building/occupancy permit + BFP re-eval; new product line → DTI-BPS/DENR if regulated), obtain approvals before the changed activity, and surrender/cancel permits on site closure (VS-59)
Responsible (R): Domain Owner / Legal / Compliance Operations
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4856_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4856_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4856_Task8" name="Update the register (W4842), evidence (W4846), and calendar (W4845); confirm no…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Update the register (W4842), evidence (W4846), and calendar (W4845); confirm no orphaned/invalid permits remain after closure/transfer; feed variation-volume and closure-compliance to analytics (W4862) and governance (W4864)
Responsible (R): Compliance Operations
Accountable (A): Compliance Portfolio Manager
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4856_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4856_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4856_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
