        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-729 (ensure controlled execution — Renewal Execution, Inspection Coordination &amp; Multi-Site Campaigns (PA-166.2).) | - CTL-729: change-triggers assessed for permit impact; variations approved before changed activity; closure permits surrendered
Owner: Compliance Operations / Domain Owners</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
